---
---

<section class="w-full bg-surface py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-outline">
	<div class="container-page">
		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-gutter-desktop lg:grid-cols-12">
			<!-- Text details -->
			<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:col-span-6">
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
					<span class="font-caption text-caption font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">
						Cobertura Geográfica
					</span>
					<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary max-w-[44rem]">
						Descentralización patrimonial: El Eje Norte del Perú.
					</h2>
				</div>
				<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
					Mientras los mercados inmobiliarios de la capital sufren saturación y rentabilidades decrecientes, la macro-región norte —con epicentro en Lambayeque, La Libertad y Piura— experimenta un dinamismo sin precedentes en proyectos de vida campestre, playa y condominios cerrados con altos estándares de habitabilidad.
				</p>

				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 pt-2 sm:grid-cols-3">
					<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-2xl bg-surface-tinted border border-outline p-4 shadow-level-1">
						<span class="font-title-md text-title-md font-bold text-primary">Chiclayo & Pimentel</span>
						<span class="font-caption text-caption font-semibold text-accent">Hub Campestre y Costero</span>
						<p class="mt-1 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-muted">Alta plusvalía en lotes con servicios completos.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-2xl bg-surface-tinted border border-outline p-4 shadow-level-1">
						<span class="font-title-md text-title-md font-bold text-primary">Trujillo</span>
						<span class="font-caption text-caption font-semibold text-accent">Expansión Residencial</span>
						<p class="mt-1 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-muted">Departamentos y condominios privados de vanguardia.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-2xl bg-surface-tinted border border-outline p-4 shadow-level-1">
						<span class="font-title-md text-title-md font-bold text-primary">Piura & Playas</span>
						<span class="font-caption text-caption font-semibold text-accent">Inversión & Renta</span>
						<p class="mt-1 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-muted">Propiedades de descanso con alto rendimiento temporal.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl bg-surface-tinted border border-outline p-4">
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px] shrink-0 text-accent">pin_drop</span>
					<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-primary">
						Oficinas comerciales centrales en Chiclayo con cobertura técnica presencial en toda la costa norte.
					</span>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Visual / Map Graphic Column -->
			<div class="lg:col-span-6">
				<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-card bg-primary p-8 text-white shadow-level-3 border border-primary-elevated">
					<div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-accent/15 blur-3xl"></div>

					<div class="relative z-10 mb-8 flex items-center justify-between">
						<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-outline-accent">
							Mapa de Operaciones Activas
						</span>
						<span class="rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 font-caption text-caption text-white backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10">
							Norte Peruano
						</span>
					</div>

					<!-- Territory Nodes Visual -->
					<div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-4">
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-primary-elevated/80 border border-white/10 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
								<div class="h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
								<div>
									<span class="block font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold text-white">Chiclayo Metropolitano & Pimentel</span>
									<span class="font-caption text-caption text-white/60">3 proyectos activos en preventa y entrega inmediata</span>
								</div>
							</div>
							<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-outline-accent">+18.4% Plusvalía Anual</span>
						</div>

						<div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-primary-elevated/80 border border-white/10 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
								<div class="h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
								<div>
									<span class="block font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold text-white">Monsefú / Reque (Corredor Ecológico)</span>
									<span class="font-caption text-caption text-white/60">Condominios de campo con amenidades premium</span>
								</div>
							</div>
							<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-outline-accent">+15.2% Retorno Estimado</span>
						</div>

						<div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-primary-elevated/80 border border-white/10 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
								<div class="h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
								<div>
									<span class="block font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold text-white">Eje Costero Piura / Máncora</span>
									<span class="font-caption text-caption text-white/60">Lotes residenciales de playa y micro-villas</span>
								</div>
							</div>
							<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold text-outline-accent">Alta Demanda Vacacional</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Metric Callout -->
					<div class="relative z-10 mt-8 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-white/10 pt-6 text-white/80">
						<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm">Superficie total bajo masterplans aliados:</span>
						<span class="font-title-lg text-title-lg font-bold text-white">142 Hectáreas</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
